From 6aafff7d0809ca32987c134b953aa430abc6f714 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:08:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Move player, input and tui under api/; split core
 cooldown/state/queue/lib

Top-level player/, input/ and tui/ move to api/player/, api/input/ and api/tui/.
core/cooldown, core/state, core/queue and core/lib split by use:
- entry points with no in-repo caller: api/cooldown, api/state, api/queue
  (queue, state, cooldown) and systems/lib/ (lib)
- everything else (helpers, handlers, underscore names) to core/internal/core/

All function references (function calls, string data, tags, headers) are
rewritten. Tag IDs (#vortex:...) and advancement IDs are not touched.
125 stale .mcfunction header IDs now match their paths (comment-only).
